{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And he was not in the assembly of Korah.</b> For their judgment was that their property would be lost under ban, since Moses our teacher banned them, saying: סוּרוּ נָא מֵעַל אָהֳלֵי הָאֲנָשִׁים הָרְשָׁעִים הָאֵלֶּה וְאַל תִּגְּעוּ בְּכָל אֲשֶׁר לָהֶם פֶּן תִּסָּפוּ (Numbers 16:26). And so they were judged in the heavenly court, as it says: וְאֵת כָּל הָרְכוּשׁ (Numbers 16:32)." "<b>For he died for his own sin.</b> The punishment for his sin was only that he would die, not that his property would be lost to the heirs."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:14.892751128Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}